      "id": "claim_0aa6a7c7694c4fcdaad93637b7830869",
      "statement": "RasterizerVulkan obtains graphics state through PipelineCache and configures the selected pipeline before recording the draw. DispatchCompute separately selects a compute pipeline and configures it with guest memory, the scheduler and resource caches. A wrong guest register or binding should be traced through the rasterizer before the window's presentation path.",
